The nums is a list of -1, 0, 1, and 2.
Sort nums.
The last is the last position of nums.
For every first from 0 to last.
The second is one more than first.
The third is last.
Repeat while second is less than third.
The total is item first of nums plus item second of nums plus item third of nums.
If total is less than 0, add 1 to second.
If total is more than 0, subtract 1 from third.
If total is 0, show item first of nums, show item second of nums, show item third of nums, show "---", add 1 to second, subtract 1 from third.
